name mpfonts
category Package
revision 54512
shortdesc Computer Modern Type 3 fonts converted using MetaPost
longdesc The Computer Modern fonts are available in Type 1 format, but
longdesc these renditions are somewhat thin and spindly, and produce
longdesc much lighter results than the originals. It is alternatively
longdesc possible to use Metafont bitmaps, but this has its
longdesc disadvantages in comparison with vector fonts. These fonts are
longdesc conversions to Type 3 fonts, done entirely in MetaPost; they
longdesc are vector fonts which are a direct conversion from the
longdesc original Metafont files, so they are the design most authentic
longdesc to the originals. However, these fonts, because they are
longdesc PostScript Type 3 fonts, are not suitable for on-screen
longdesc reading, and should probably only be used for printing. Note:
longdesc do NOT add the map file to updmap!
